.TH blocked 1  "blocked " 
.SH NAME
blocked \- List blocked items (open, with an open blocker or in a cycle). Ranked by default; override with `\-\-sort id`
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBblocked\fR [\fB\-\-sort\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List blocked items (open, with an open blocker or in a cycle). Ranked by default; override with `\-\-sort id`
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-sort\fR \fI<SORT>\fR
Sort order: `rank` | `id` (default `rank`). An unknown key is a loud error
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
